Hi,

No, you cannot set the estimate or the standard error.

What you can do and indeed do below is to set the population values. The estimates converge to those population values if the estimator is consistent and the sample size is large. So you are not really setting the estimates, but your scenario is such that the estimates will get close to the population values.

There is no population counterpart for a standard errors, which simply estimates the precision of the estimates.

Mikko

